Dear all,

Some of the details escape me, but as advertised, rj is not supposed
to install successfully on Ubuntu 14.04 64bit (kernel 3.13). I tried
both OpenJDK 7 and Oracle 8 and the process always fails at some
point, the installer struggles to find various Java resources. Since
you can install different Java versions from different sources, the
symptoms of this problem can look different from system to system.

Luckily, this post provides a fix:

